UID:10047388-1779303600-1779310800@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Brothers Of The Heart at American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to welcome Brothers of the Heart back to American Music Theatre! \nSuper groups have a prestigious history in the music industry from such legendary rockers as The Traveling Wilburys to the iconic country foursome The Highwaymen to the stellar trio of Dolly Parton\, Emmylou Harris\, and Linda Ronstadt.  There’s a special excitement when successful artists combine their individual talents and star power to create something fresh and exciting.  That tradition continues with Brothers Of The Heart – Jimmy Fortune\, Bradley Walker\, Mike Rogers\, and Ben Isaacs – who reimagine country\, gospel\, and pop classics with their renditions of iconic songs such as “Ring of Fire\,” “Desperado\,” “Bye Bye Love\,” “Precious Memories\,” and more. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/brothers-of-the-heart-american-music-theatre/2026-05-20/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Highway East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Concert,Entertainment,Live Music,Musical Events,Route 30
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/american-music-theatre-event-brothers.jpg
GEO:40.0248492;-76.2005132
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=American Music Theatre 2425 Lincoln Highway East Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2425 Lincoln Highway East:geo:-76.2005132,40.0248492
END:VEVENT
