DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260521
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTSTAMP:20260520T175421
CREATED:20240513T152557Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251126T180323Z
UID:10043980-1779321600-1779407999@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Date Night In Amish Country with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:You’ll be head over heels as you and your date cruise through scenic country roads with our expert guides\, followed by dinner at a local watering hole*. It’s a fun activity that’s unique to Lancaster\, PA and romantic. Looking for other unique date ideas? View our list of unique things to do in Lancaster\, PA\, for couples. And while we can’t promise a sunset view over rolling farmland\, we can tell you that locals and visitors alike enjoy this date activity in Lancaster\, PA. Looking for unique weekend activities to complement your tour? View 8 things to do on a Sunday in Lancaster\, PA. \nItinerary\nEach trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \nTours include: \n\nA quick guided tour through the countryside and local\, covered bridges of Lancaster County\n\nA certificate for mini-golf at nearby Village Greens or a $25 certificate to your choice of Fireside Tavern or beSpoke Brewing. Book Now. * \n*Guests have their choice of passes for miniature golf and ice cream at Village Greens where each guest will receive a pass\, or guests can receive their choice of a $25 gift card to Fireside Tavern or Bespoke Brewing\, where they’ll receive one gift card per couple (2 guests).
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-date-night/2026-05-21/
LOCATION:Strasburg Scooter Tours\, 246 N Decatur Street\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,July 4th Independence Day,Labor Day,Memorial Day Weekend,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, Pennsylvania,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Date-Night.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancasterpa": "https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-scootin-for-scoops/2026-05-21/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancasterpa
X-SOURCE:Discover Lancaster
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260521
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTSTAMP:20260520T175421
CREATED:20240513T184004Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251126T193800Z
UID:10044079-1779321600-1779407999@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Scootin’ for Scoops with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a 5-star Lancaster County ice cream tour experience with Strasburg Scooter Tours. You’ll see rolling farmlands\, pass by horse and buggies\, and enjoy some of the best Ice Cream in Lancaster County! It’s a stark contrast to the usual fast-paced and congested areas of larger cities. For those craving something different or one of the best romantic date night ideas\, join us! \nWe designed this tour to be an experience you can share with someone. We’ll only use Scoot Coupes\, so single riders will have to look for someone to bring on the tour. It will be well worth it as you can expect exceptional views. Bond throughout the experience alongside our expert guide and relish some tasty ice cream* as we Ride around the rolling farmland surrounding the Village of Intercourse and Bird-in-Hand\, PA. \n>> Check Out Our Ice Cream Tour in Strasburg\, PA \nItinerary\nSome of our past tours have included: \n\nAn evening drive through PA Dutch Country\nBeautiful rolling farm-scapes and off-the-beaten-path adventures\nA stop at one of the best ice cream shops that Amish Country has to offer*\n\nAnd each trip is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you! \n*Unfortunately\, we regret to inform you that some of the food offerings on the tour may not be considered ‘Kosher.’ We apologize for any inconvenience.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/strasburg-scooter-tours-scootin-for-scoops/2026-05-21/
LOCATION:Strasburg Scooter Tours\, 246 N Decatur Street\, Strasburg\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Food & Beverage Events,July 4th Independence Day,Labor Day,Memorial Day Weekend,Outdoor Activities,Strasburg, Pennsylvania,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Scootin-for-Scoops.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancasterpa": "https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lancaster-city-scavenger-hunt/2026-05-21/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancasterpa
X-SOURCE:Discover Lancaster
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260521
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTSTAMP:20260520T175421
CREATED:20250708T131037Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251008T153715Z
UID:10045187-1779321600-1779407999@lancasterpa.com
SUMMARY:Lancaster City Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:Imagine turning the streets of Lancaster into a real-life adventure—solving puzzles\, uncovering secrets\, and winning prizes along the way!\nNow’s your chance! Introducing Lancaster’s Ultimate Scavenger Challenge\, created by Unique Lancaster Experiences—where discovery\, excitement\, and local charm come together. \n🧭 Your Adventure Awaits:\n🧩 Follow inventive clues through Lancaster’s picturesque and historic downtown\n🎁 Earn fun rewards as you complete challenges\n🌿 Discover tucked-away gardens\, arcades\, historic markets\, and more\n🛍 Access special discounts at participating local businesses\n⏱ Choose your pace—go head-to-head with friends or enjoy a leisurely journey \n🌟 What Makes It Unforgettable?\n👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Great for everyone—couples\, families\, birthday celebrations\, team events\, or spontaneous outings\n🎭 Hands-On & Entertaining—history comes to life through interactive games\, not lectures\n📸 Creative Challenges—snap silly photos\, solve riddles\, and compete for glory\n📞 On-Call Help—first-time visitor? A friendly local guide is available if you need hints\n🎁 Awesome Gift Idea—for Lancaster natives and curious newcomers alike \n📱 Getting Started Is Easy:\n1.Reserve your tickets—just one per player\n2.Check your email for download instructions\n3.Watch a quick briefing video to get ready\n4.Meet your team at the Welcome Center\n5.Dive into a one-of-a-kind city experience!\n🎟 Spots are limited—reserve yours today! Whether you’re exploring Lancaster for the first time or rediscovering its charm\, this scavenger adventure will change how you see the city! \n*** Please note that some days offer multiple start times
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lancaster-city-scavenger-hunt/2026-05-21/
LOCATION:Unique Lancaster\, 23 N Walnut Street\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Lancaster City,Tour
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/scavenger-hunt--e1751993312200.png
END:VEVENT
