SUMMARY:Lititz Farmer's Market
DESCRIPTION:Fresh. Local. Fun. The Lititz Farmers Market brings together our favorite things\, in one of our favorite Lititz spots. Head to Lititz Springs Park on Thursdays from May 16th through October 17th for fresh produce\, baked goods (including gluten free!)\, fresh flowers\, granola\, dog treats\, fermented goods\, and more! Each week we’ll feature a local food truck and a local band. Weekly prepared food includes Thai food\, Scandinavian food\, and pupusas from El Salvador. We also have fun\, free kids’ activities. \nWe’d love it if you’d join us\, from 4pm to dusk. \n\nAdditional Shopping & Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nAmish Products\nConsignment and Thrift Shops\nFarmers Markets\nFurniture\n\n\n\nQuilt Supplies and Fabrics\nGifts & Collectibles\nTheater\, Music\, & the Arts\nKids’ Attractions\nAdults & Couples\n\n\n\nRailroad Attractions\nHistorical & Educational\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/lititz-farmers-market-2/
LOCATION:Lititz Springs Park\, 24 N. Broad Street\, Lititz\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Farmers Markets,Garden,Lititz, Pennsylvania,Local Artisian,Market,Outdoor Activities,Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Event-Lititz-Farmers-Market.png
GEO:40.1562632;-76.3075293
