UID:589155d04d8b0c35018fa377fe81838c@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Adults\n\nEphrata Area Social Services (EASS) will
  be onsite at the library every 4th Wednesday of the month from 10 AM–12
  PM to answer questions about their free programs\, including food insecur
 ity support\, case management\, transitional housing\, and transportation.
  Stop by to meet their friendly team\, ask questions\, and learn more abou
