SUMMARY:Teen Book Talk: The Summer I Turned Pretty
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260527T190000
UID:372ea8553732661e240f1afc531d61ff@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Teens\n\nFor Teens ages 13-18 years of age only.Ca
 lling all teen readers! Join us for Teen Book Talk\, a fun and engaging mo
 nthly book discussion group led by members of our Teen Advisory Board! Boo
 k selections are chosen by teens during advisory meetings. Interested in j
 oining the Teen Advisory Board? Sign up through the library calendar. Each
  month\, we’ll dive into a new title—ranging from trending young adult
  fiction to graphic novels\, fantasy epics\, thought-provoking contemporar
 y stories\, and more.This month we'll be reading "The Summer I Turned Pret
 ty" by Jenny Han.You’ll get the chance to share your thoughts\, hear dif
 ferent perspectives\, and connect with fellow book lovers in a relaxed and
  welcoming space. We will discuss the characters of Belly\, Conrad\, and J
 eremiah and any of your favorite moments from the book.Note: To help every
 one stay present and get the most out of the experience\, we ask that all 
 phones stay in pockets or bags during the program. Thank you for your coop
 eration!Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel thei
 r registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restric
 ted from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s tim
 e. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of
  the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of thei
 r change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes
  prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumst
 ances. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this tim
 e\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be gran
 ted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. 
 However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes
  past the start time.Check In - All participants must provide an emergency
  contact number upon registration or at the start of the program.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-book-talk-summer-i-
 turned-pretty-178363
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
