UID:10000781-1780081200-1780092000@mickeysblackbox.com
SUMMARY:Superunknown - The 35 Tour
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 29th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\n2 FULL Albums\n1 GREAT Night \nCelebrate the 35th anniversary of 2 amazing grunge albums – Temple of the Dog and Badmotorfinger. \nInternationally touring Chris Cornell Tribute\, SUPERUNKNOWN presents this -One of a Kind- Double album show. \nSuperunknown has performed all over the world with their unparalleled tribute to Chris Cornell.  In 2026 they will be performing Temple of the Dogs self-titled debut along with Soundgardens groundbreaking\, Badmotorfinger.  \nBoth albums will be performed back to back in their entirety.  \nCheck out Superunknown here!\nWebsite | Facebook\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/superunknown-the-35-tour/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/02/SUPERUNKNOWN-10.18-9-IG.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Amtshows": "https://amtshows.com/show/lee-brice-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:amtshows
X-SOURCE:American Music Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260529T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260529T200000
DTSTAMP:20260521T002406
CREATED:20251117T143054Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T123603Z
UID:10001833-1780084800-1780084800@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Lee Brice with special guest Payton Smith
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $99 $109 $119 $139\n \nGet ready for an unforgettable night of country music when Lee Brice takes the stage at American Music Theatre! Known for his powerhouse vocals\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-topping hits like “Hard to Love\,” “I Don’t Dance\,” “One of Them Girls\,” and “Rumor\,” Brice delivers a show packed with energy\, emotion\, and authenticity. \nA multi-platinum artist\, songwriter\, and CMA award-winner\, Lee Brice brings together the raw honesty of classic country with a modern edge that resonates with fans of all ages. Whether he’s performing tender ballads or high-energy anthems\, his passion and stage presence make every song hit home. \nRising country artist Payton Smith brings a fresh\, heartfelt sound to the stage—blending modern country energy with the storytelling roots that define the genre. Hailing from Louisiana\, Smith has quickly made a name for himself with his smooth vocals\, relatable lyrics\, and a style that bridges classic influences with today’s country sound. \nSince breaking onto the scene\, he’s earned attention from fans and industry alike\, touring with major acts and releasing songs that capture everything from young love to life on the road. With a mix of infectious melodies and genuine emotion\, Smith delivers a live show that feels both intimate and high-energy. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/lee-brice-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LB_Concessions-Events-1920x1080_wsg_Payton_Smith.jpg
END:VEVENT
