DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Children\n\nMaster Gardeners Miss Sherry and Mi
 ss Barbara will teach us all about seeds.  Each participant will make a pa
 per pot and plant a seed to bring home.Ages 5-8Space is limited · Thank y
