LAST-MODIFIED:20251107T195648Z
UID:10001827-1780171200-1780171200@amtshows.com
SUMMARY:Lou Gramm: The Voice of Foreigner
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $69 $79 $89\n \nGet ready to relive the soundtrack of the late ’70s and ’80s when Lou Gramm\, the legendary original lead singer of Foreigner\, takes the stage at American Music Theatre! With one of rock’s most unmistakable voices\, Gramm’s powerful vocals helped define an era\, fronting chart-topping hits like “I Want to Know What Love Is\,” “Cold as Ice\,” “Hot Blooded\,” “Juke Box Hero\,” and “Double Vision.” \nIn this electrifying live concert\, Lou and his band deliver the energy\, passion\, and powerhouse vocals that made Foreigner one of the most successful rock bands of all time. Fans can expect a night packed with classics\, deep cuts\, and maybe a few surprises from Lou’s acclaimed solo career — including his hit “Midnight Blue.” \nExperience the timeless voice\, the unforgettable songs\, and the rock ’n’ roll spirit that continue to inspire generations. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/lou-gramm-the-voice-of-foreigner/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/LG_Concessions-Events-and-News-for-Website-1920x1080-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
