 fly by Katherine Pryor\, winner of the 2024 Junior Master Gardener Book Aw
 ard. It tells the story of the great monarch migration. Butterflies and mo
 ths (Lepidoptera) are important pollinators. While not as efficient as bee
 s\, they carry pollen over long distances and are especially important for
  many wildflowers and herbs. Participants will also complete a simple craf
 t.Ages 2-8. Limit 25 children. Registration required. Please register each
