DESCRIPTION:Technology Class\, Seniors\n\nJoin us for this Computer 101 co
 urse taught by Lisa Ference with the Goodwill Mobile Learning Lab. Lisa wi
 ll be here on June 4\, 11\, 18\, and July 2 to teach individuals how to us
 e computers. This is a series where each class builds on the next. If you 
 register\, please be prepared to attend all sessions. Sessions will run fr
 om 1 PM - 3 PM on the listed dates. See below for a short bio on the class
  instructor:Your instructor is Lisa Ference\, who has a B.S. in Computer S
 cience from Desales University. She is a retired FBI Supervisory Special A
 gent who investigated computer crimes and intrusions for the FBI in New Yo
 rk City. She now works at Goodwill Keystone Area\, providing learning oppo
 rtunities in the Lehigh Valley and surrounding counties.
