DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260608T200000
UID:09610613e043da02e3475a3bacb24d6a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\n🦋 Turn Your 
 Backyard into a Wild Sanctuary 🌿Ever wondered how to bring more life to
  your landscape? Join Heather Titanich from the Stroud Water Research Cent
 er for an insider’s look at the magic of streamside forests. Whether you
  have a sprawling acre or a cozy garden plot\, Heather will share her favo
 rite tips & tricks for using native plants to attract stunning new species
  to your property. Learn how the right tree or shrub can turn your outdoor
  space into a thriving habitat.Discover the best native plants for your so
 il 🔍🌱Learn pro-tips for attracting rare species 🦉✨Grow a legacy
 \, no matter your property size! 🌎❤️
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-lancaster-water
 -week-event-partnership-stroud-center-164401
