 onnecting books with our animal friends. This month we will celebrate the 
 creatures who live in our oceans in honor of World Ocean’s Day! We will 
 read a story or two with a favorite ocean character then enjoy activity st
 ations spotlighting this month's animal star. Each station will have a cra
 ft or fun activity. Whether you're roaring like a lion\, hopping like a ka
 ngaroo\, or swimming like a fish\, there's a place for everyone in our wil
