X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Teen Video Gaming: Mario Kart
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T160000
UID:36110163dc007e0455064ba8efa85eaa@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nJoin us at the library for 
 our first gaming event of the summer as we host a Mario Kart Tournament. F
 or each round of racing the top players will move forward in the brackets 
 until we have our ultimate Mario Kart champion. This program is for teens 
 ages 13-18 years only. Registration for Teen Video Gaming: Mario Kart will
  open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, May 27th for Manheim Township and East Lamp
 eter residents and on Wednesday\, June 3rd for residents of other municipa
 lities.Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their
  registration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restrict
 ed from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time
 . Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of 
 the program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their
  change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes 
 prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumsta
 nces. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time
 \, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be grant
 ed entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. H
 owever\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes 
 past the start time.Drop Off Program – This program is intended for chil
 dren over the age of 13 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) 
 must be present to check in child with youth services staff prior to progr
 am. Adults will not be allowed in the event space. Check In - All particip
 ants must provide an emergency contact number upon registration or at the 
 start of the program.Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age restri
 ctions designated on your registration. Only children in that age range wi
 ll be admitted.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/teen-video-gaming-mario-
 kart-175081
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
