 ading a book with the naturalist\, going on a dinosaur hunt\, making their
  own observations\, and creating their own dinosaurs with unique adaptatio
 ns. Everyone will finish with a game of pin the tail on the dinosaurs.🦕
 Registration for Dino Tales will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd fo
 r Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, June 10t
 h for residents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies  Registra
 tion Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, please register every
