 allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly
  at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to tho
 se on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registran
 ts may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be 
 permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. Accompanying
  Adults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. P
 lease plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be
  permitted. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Cond
 uct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (includi
 ng children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consen
 t of a parent or guardian).
