BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/do-not-publish-summer-chess-club-161036"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Summer Chess Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260616T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260616T190000
UID:5ca43bfce0749594921db022a8c02b84@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nJoin th
 e Manheim Township High School Chess Team for an exciting Summer Chess Clu
 b at the Manheim Township Public Library! Whether you're a total beginner 
 or a future grandmaster\, this is the perfect place to learn\, play\, and 
 sharpen your skills in a fun\, friendly atmosphere.🌟 All skill levels w
 elcome!♟ Ages 6-14🧠 Challenge yourself\, make new friends\, and maste
 r the game!Chess sets will be provided—just bring your love for the game
  (or your curiosity to learn)!Ready to make your move? See you there! ♟
 ✨Registration for Summer Chess Club will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, J
 une 3rd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\
 , June 10th for residents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies
 No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 l
 ibrary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future 
 programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrati
 ons at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those 
 on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.
 Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progr
 am to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pr
 omptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited 
 to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, reg
 istrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not b
 e permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off Pr
 ogram – This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years wh
 o can participate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in chil
 d with youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed i
 n the event space. *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\;
  however\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the p
 rogram room for the duration of the program.In accordance with library pol
 icy\, children ages 8 and up may be in the library unaccompanied.Designate
 d Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your regist
 ration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- Pl
 ease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has no
 t been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code o
 f Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (i
 ncluding children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the 
 consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/do-not-publish-summer-ch
 ess-club-161036
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
