UID:76b477143862d61f4e8dab4412a2d3c5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\nCome join Snapology for Po
 ke-Heroes. Students will build and explore the world of Pokemon as they cr
 eate their own gyms\, battles\, and even their very own generation of Poke
 mon. Children will also learn about real world science as they learn about
  the habitats of the Pokemon. Your child will have a blast becoming the be
 st Pokemon trainer ever.Please only register for one session of this progr
 am. Duplicate registrations will be cancelled.This program is for children
  ages 6-9 years of age. Please see more information below in our policies.
 Registration for Pokemania Habitats presented by Lancaster Snapology will 
 open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd for Manheim Township and East Lampe
 ter residents and on Wednesday\, June 10th for residents of other municipa
 lities. Library Program PoliciesDrop Off Program – This program is int
 ended for children over the age of 6 years who can participate independent
 ly. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff p
 rior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  *For ch
 ildren ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; however\, a parent or c
 aregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the program room for the 
 duration of the program. No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their regis
 tration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted fro
 m registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Plea
 se cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the pr
 ogram to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their chang
 e in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior 
 to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. 
 The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, you
 r spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted ent
 ry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However
 \, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past t
 he start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center BC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/hold-snapology-175354
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
