SUMMARY:Science Building Blocks with Hands On House
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T160000
UID:8c0ea0ff039e8bbe5fd0a049c2c45db7@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\nBuild\, test\, and discove
 r with Hands-on House! Young scientists will explore the exciting forces o
 f gravity\, magnetism\, and light while using the Scientific Method to inv
 estigate how the world works. Through hands-on experiments with raceways\,
  kaleidoscopes\, magnets\, and more\, students will hypothesize\, predict\
 , observe\, and test their ideas like real scientists. Get ready for a fun
 -filled program full of creativity\, curiosity\, and discovery!This progra
 m is for children ages 6-9 years of age. Please see more information below
  in our policies.Registration for Science Building Blocks presented by Han
 ds on House will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd for Manheim Townsh
 ip and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, June 10th for residents 
 of other municipalities.Library Program Policies Drop Off Program – Th
 is program is intended for children over the age of 6 years who can partic
 ipate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth
  services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event 
 space.  *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; howeve
 r\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the progra
 m room for the duration of the program. No Show – Patrons failing to
  cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a month wil
 l be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of one m
 onth’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to 
 the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be notified
  of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive
  10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parking and
  other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designated ti
 me. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list w
 ho will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed int
 o the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter th
 e program 5 minutes past the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/science-building-blocks-
 hands-house-177987
