DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T144500
UID:e7f6c0ee571679f4cacead2dc6c101f2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\n\nCome have some fun exploring some simple ma
 chines and how they work - we'll use Mo Willem's Pigeon as our inspiration
 .  Remember how that Pigeon wanted to drive the bus? We'll finally give hi
 m the chance he's waited for!  🚌Vroom! Vroom! 😄This program is desig
 ned for kids ages 6 - 9 years old. *Registration will open at 9:00AM on We
 dnesday\, June 3rd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on
  Wednesday\, June 10th for residents of other municipalities.Library Progr
 am Policies No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for
  more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registeri
 ng for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel y
 our registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to al
 low those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registrati
 on status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the s
 tart of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The prog
 ram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot w
 ill be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If s
 pots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regis
 trants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time. Drop Off Program – This program is intended for children ov
 er the age of 6 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) must be 
 present to check in child with youth services staff prior to program. Adul
 ts will not be allowed in the event space.  *For children ages 6–7\,
  this is a drop-off program\; however\, a parent or caregiver must remai
 n nearby and wait outside the program room for the duration of the progr
 am. Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated
  on your registration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.
    Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify
  that the program has not been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/stem-simple-machines-173
 937
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
