 \, hosted by the MTPL Teen Advisory Board! For Teens ages 13-18 years of a
 ge only.Put your knowledge to the test and enjoy a fun evening with friend
 s.Snacks and drinks provided!Teams are welcome.Prizes will be awarded!Regi
 stration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 10th for Manheim Township
  and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, June 17th for residents of
  other municipalities.Check In - All participants must provide an emergenc
 y contact number upon registration or at the start of the program.No Show 
 – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library
  programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future progra
 ms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at
  least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow those on the wai
 ting list to be notified of their change in registration status. Late Arri
 vals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program 
 to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promp
 tly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to 
 those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regist
 rants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not 
 be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. Designate
 d Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your regi
 stration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.
