SUMMARY:Mr. Mike's: Dinorific Scientific Name Game
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260626T113000
UID:d27594dc95c9450767db9a99f09c05e5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens
 \, Adults\, Seniors\n\nThe  DINORIFIC SCIENTIFIC NAME GAME  is "so easy to
  play...yet so hard to win!"Here's the challenge: can you tell the differe
 nce between an actual ancient animal name...and one that Mr. Mike made up?
   Good luck!  Contestants compete for cool dino prizes while the audience 
 weighs in with their own opinions.  Registration for The Dinorific Scienti
 fic Name Game will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 10th for Manheim Tow
 nship and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, June 17th for residen
 ts of other municipalities.Registration Requirements – To help us manage
  our space\, please register every person who will be attending\, includin
 g adults or siblings. *For the safety and supervision of all participants:
  Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the
  program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program inde
 pendently.  Library Policies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their r
 egistration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted
  from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. 
 Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of th
 e program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their c
 hange in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes pr
 ior to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstanc
 es. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\,
  your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted
  entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. How
 ever\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes pa
 st the start time.PhotographyThe Manheim Township Public Library Code of C
 onduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (incl
 uding children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the con
 sent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/mr-mikes-dinorific-scien
 tific-name-game-161035
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
