X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/seriously-silly-show-cissy-and-man-167849"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:A Seriously Silly Show with Cissy and the Man
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T141500
UID:5ad9d8f19a8f2328ba1d687a80f9a300@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults
 \n\nThe joy of the circus comes to life when this juggler/clown duo comes 
 barreling through the door. Cissy and The Man delight their audiences with
  humor\, joy and skill. But the hardest part is working together! Will Cis
 sy successfully assist The Man\, or will children from the audience need t
 o be recruited?Cissy and The Man are a juggling and clowning duo from Manh
 eim. You can find them performing at festivals\, parades\, carnivals\, sch
 ools and churches. With over 40 years of combined experience\, Cissy and T
 he Man use juggling\, balancing\, clowning and audience participation to k
 eep their viewers smiling and wanting more. Learn more at cissyandtheman.c
 omAppropriate for all ages*For the safety and supervision of all participa
 nts: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout
  the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program 
 independently.  Registration for Cissy and the Man will open at 9:00AM on 
 Wednesday\, June 17th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and
  on Wednesday\, June 24th for residents of other municipalities.Registrati
 on Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, please register every p
 erson who will be attending\, including adults or siblings. Library Polici
 es:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 
 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for futu
 re programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registr
 ations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for tho
 se on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration stat
 us.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the pr
 ogram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin
  promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeit
 ed to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, 
 registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will no
 t be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Cancella
 tions- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the progr
 am has not been cancelled.Photography - The Manheim Township Public Librar
 y Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording indivi
 duals (including children) without their consent (or in the case of a chil
