DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260629T190000
UID:15be08602703ebc5c9a4307a75559c83@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nRegistration for 
 Lego Block Party will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 17th for Manheim 
 Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, June 24th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.For youth ages 8-12 years of age only.The LE
 GO Block Party at the library is a fun and creative program where children
  ages 8-12 come together to build various creations using LEGO bricks. Par
 ticipants often have the opportunity to work individually or in teams to d
 esign and construct imaginative structures\, vehicles\, and scenes based o
 n a theme or their own imagination. The club typically fosters collaborati
 on\, problem-solving\, and fine motor skills while encouraging a love for 
 building and creativity. It's a great way for community members to sociali
 ze\, learn\, and have fun in a supportive environment.Library Program Poli
 ciesDesignated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated
  on your registration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.
    No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more t
 han 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for 
 future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your reg
 istrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for
  those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration 
 status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of th
 e program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will b
 egin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be for
 feited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remai
 n\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants wil
 l not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Chec
 k In - All participants must provide an emergency contact number upon regi
 stration or at the start of the program.Cancellations- Please check your e
 mail prior to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lego-block-party-172195
