DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\
 n\nCoffee With a Colonial gives the opportunity to have a moment to sit do
 wn and enjoy sipping through history\, enjoying a favorite beverage with d
 iscussion and interacting with 18th century material culture. Where the wo
 rld is so busy today\, Sam Leamer invites you to take a pause and enjoy th
 e simple pleasure of conversation over and about coffee\, either 18th or t
 he 21st century varieties. An interactive display of 18th century civilian
  and soldiering life will be provided. Ages 12+.
