BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/erick-hershey-magic-and-mystery-american-history-161266"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Erick Hershey The Magic and Mystery of American History
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T111500
UID:608652a561295670e537df5846adb870@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults
 \n\nAmeri-ca-dabra!  Hear\, ye!  Hear\, ye!  We are thrilled to announce o
 ur brand new show\, celebrating the Magic and Mystery of American History!
   This 45 minute show combines Erick Hershey's love of American History\, 
 Magic\, and Teaching (Erick has also been an educator for over 20 years)\,
  and blends it into a magical journey back to the Colonial era! Registrati
 on for Erick Hershey The Magic and Mystery of American History will open a
 t 9:00AM on Wednesday\, June 17th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter r
 esidents and on Wednesday\, June 24th for residents of other municipalitie
 s.Registration Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, please regi
 ster every person who will be attending\, including adults or siblings.*Fo
 r the safety and supervision of all participants: Children under 8 years o
 ld must be accompanied by an adult throughout the program. Children ages 8
  and older are welcome to attend the program independently.  Library Polic
 ies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than
  2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for fut
 ure programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your regist
 rations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for th
 ose on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration sta
 tus.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the p
 rogram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begi
 n promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfei
 ted to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\,
  registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will n
 ot be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Cancell
 ations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the prog
 ram has not been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Libr
 ary Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording indi
 viduals (including children) without their consent (or in the case of a ch
 ild\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/erick-hershey-magic-and-
 mystery-american-history-161266
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
