SUMMARY:Ameri-ca-dabra! The Magic and Mystery of American History!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T143000
UID:7cb0c36a64159ee28e095f8fe4a97271@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Everyone\n\nThe Magic of Erick Hershey and Co
 untry Conjuring Magic proudly presents our educational magic show\, “Ame
 ri-ca-dabra!”\, an inspiring and fun journey through the founding of our
  great nation. Told through entertaining and amazing magic\, this interact
 ive show brings to life many of the important places\, heroic people and f
 oundational documents that forged our nation. George Washington\, Betsy Ro
 ss\, Paul Revere\, the Declaration of Independence\, the Liberty Bell and 
 the history of our American Flags all come to life through magic! All ages
 .
LOCATION:Ephrata\, EPH Multipurpose Room
