UID:6d9f4fd45a88cca91bae1f060e5f34e6@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Storytime\, Summer Rea
 ding\, Toddlers\n\nAnimals that roam the earth today have special adaptati
 ons for survival. Dinosaurs thousands of years ago had their own adaptatio
 ns\, but theirs were bigger and bolder. Participants will learn about dino
 saur adaptations of the past by reading a book with the naturalist\, going
  on a dinosaur hunt\, making their own observations\, and creating their o
 wn dinosaurs with unique adaptations. Everyone will finish with a game of 
 pin the tail on the dinosaurs!
