 er Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes reading for fun 
 and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich variety of p
 rograms to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across all age gro
 ups.Join a Lancaster County Parks and Rec naturalist to make a dinosaur di
 scovery! Discover a dinosaur and create a story that fits its life. Learn 
