 ary’s Summer Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes read
 ing for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich 
 variety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across
  all age groups.Join Miss Rachel for stories\, songs\, and a craft and sha
 re the joy of reading with your little ones!Enjoy time with your child whi
 le building a foundation for reading success.Preschoolers (ages 3-6) will 
 enjoy this program the most\, but older and younger siblings are invited t
 o join in on the fun!Thank you for completing the registration process for
  the child(ren) in your party. Adult caregivers do not need to register.
