DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Summer Reading\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nS
 ing! Sign! Storytime!  uses stories and songs to teach basic American Sign
  Language (ASL) baby signs to children and their grown-ups\, a few signs a
 t a time.  Pick up a new language\, and improve communication skills betwe
 en you and your child\, even if your child isn’t talking yet.  It’s ea
 sy when it’s fun!Adapted from a program developed by librarian M. Stanle
 y and ASL instructor C. Schultz.Sing! Sign! Storytime! is sponsored by Rey
 nolds & Shivery Funeral Homes.
