UID:5a89a41f865806129effbe0686964a20@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nSo
 me dinosaurs\, such as the Barosaurus\, were quite large and may have weig
 hed as much as 35 tons. But other dinosaurs\, such as Compsognathus\, were
  about the size of a chicken and weighed only eight pounds. Join a Natural
 ist to learn just how big they were in comparison to modern day creatures 
 and landmarks by completing activities and putting your knowledge to the t
 est!Best suited for elementary aged children and siblings. No registration
  required.
