BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/workin-railroad-railroad-museum-pa-166985"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Workin' on the Railroad with the Railroad Museum of PA
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260715T113000
UID:5a78215c9d0ae82ac43a01a43058b60a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nRegistration for Workin'
  on the Railroad presented by the Railroad Museum of Pennsylvania will ope
 n at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 1st for Manheim Township and East Lampeter
  residents and on Wednesday\, July 8th for residents of other municipaliti
 es.Registration Requirements – To help us manage our space\, please regi
 ster every person who will be attending\, including adults or siblings.All
  aboard for a journey into the world of railroads! The Railroad Museum of 
 Pennsylvania is bringing its engaging Workin’ on the Railroad program to
  our library this summer. Families are invited to explore the fascinating 
 jobs that kept the trains running—from conductors and engineers to signa
 lmen and porters.Participants will get hands-on with real railroad tools\,
  lanterns\, uniform items\, dining car china\, ticket punches\, and more! 
 This interactive program offers a unique opportunity to connect with histo
 ry through touchable artifacts and fun stories about life on the rails.Ide
 al for school-age children (Ages 7-12) and their families\, this program i
 s perfect for curious minds who love trains\, history\, and hands-on learn
 ing.Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their re
 gistration for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted 
 from registering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. P
 lease cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the
  program to allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their ch
 ange in registration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes pri
 or to the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstance
 s. The program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, 
 your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted 
 entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. Howe
 ver\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes pas
 t the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center AB
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/workin-railroad-railroad
 -museum-pa-166985
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
