SUMMARY:Ryan The Bug Man: Let’s Take an Insect Adventure!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T143000
UID:8781039972a9d0e03471e0a2e2424cb9@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Adults\, Senio
 rs\n\nRegistration for Ryan the Bug Man: Let's Take an Insect Adventure wi
 ll open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 1st for Manheim Township and East La
 mpeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 8th for residents of other munici
 palities.Registration Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, plea
 se register every person who will be attending\, including adults or sibli
 ngs.Ryan “The BugMan” will show the audience 100’s of incredible bug
 s and insects from around the world. Meanwhile\, he’ll be relating some 
 of the crazy-cool adventures that he took while searching for many of thos
 e same creatures. Be it land\, air or sea… “The BugMan” has experien
 ced a lifetime of travel and unusual experiences that will educate and ent
 ertain everyone. Insects are the most important part of the ecosystem and 
 critical to the survival of nearly everything on the Planet!Appropriate fo
 r all ages*For the safety and supervision of all participants: Children un
 der 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the program. Ch
 ildren ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program independently.  
 Library Policies:No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration 
 for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regist
 ering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cance
 l your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to
  allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in reg
 istration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the s
 tart of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The prog
 ram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot w
 ill be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If s
 pots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regis
 trants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start
  time.PhotographyThe Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Polic
 y prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (including childr
 en) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a pa
 rent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/ryan-bug-man-lets-take-i
 nsect-adventure-161337
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
