SUMMARY:Dinosaur Discovery by Lancaster County Parks
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T113000
UID:d0976d22fa1d24597244fd44a39dd2a3@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nCome make a dino
 saur discovery 🦕and create a story that fits its life. The Naturalist w
 ill tell the beginning of a dinosaur story. When the Naturalist stops in t
 he middle of the story the participants will be asked to hunt for and find
  the parts of dinosaurs hidden in the area. As they find the parts\, the g
 roup will be challenged to piece the dinosaur back together.🦖 Each grou
 p acts out an end to the story using the dinosaur they have found\, making
  the story appropriate to the life of the dinosaur they have pieced togeth
 er. Afterwards\, we will use a silly facts activity to challenge everyone
 ’s dinosaur expertise.Registration for Dinosaur Discovery by Lancaster C
 ounty Park will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 8th for Manheim Townshi
 p and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 15th for residents o
 f other municipalities.Library Program Policies    Registration Requiremen
 ts –  To help us manage our space\, please register every person who wil
 l be attending\, including adults or siblings. No Show – Patrons faili
 ng to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a mont
 h will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period of 
 one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours prio
 r to the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to be not
 ified of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – Please a
 rrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parkin
 g and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designat
 ed time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait l
 ist who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowe
 d into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to ent
 er the program 5 minutes past the start time. Accompanying Adults – Th
 is program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to at
 tend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dinosaur-discovery-lanca
 ster-county-parks-170768
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
