  clean up and get cozy for back-to-back Lego Jurassic movies. We will be w
 atching Lego Jurassic Park: The Official Retelling (2023). With his unique
  humor and style\, chaos mathematician Dr. Ian Malcolm\, shares the tale o
 f what happened one dreadful night at Jurassic Park. Our second film will 
 be Lego Jurassic World: Indominus Escape (2016). Both films are rated PG. 
 Total runtime for both films is 47 mins. Popcorn will provided. All Ages w
 elcome.
