UID:d3b145accb11bb51d974262756450a6a@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\n\nRegistration 
 for Raven Ridge Wildlife Center will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 8t
 h for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July
  15th for residents of other municipalities.Registration Requirements – 
  To help us manage our space\, please register every person who will be at
 tending\, including adults or siblings.*For the safety and supervision of 
 all participants: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adu
 lt throughout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend
  the program independently.  Meet some wild neighbors up close! Join Raven
  Ridge Wildlife Center for an unforgettable program featuring live animal 
 ambassadors and fascinating stories from the world of wildlife rescue and 
 rehabilitation.Learn how Raven Ridge helps injured\, orphaned\, and displa
 ced wild animals—and discover what you can do to protect local wildlife 
 in your own backyard. With a mix of education\, conservation\, and real-li
 fe animal encounters\, this program is perfect for animal lovers and curio
 us minds of all ages.Live animals will be present.Library Program Policies
 No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 l
 ibrary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future 
 programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrati
 ons at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those 
 on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.
 Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progr
 am to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pr
 omptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited 
 to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, reg
 istrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not b
 e permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography
 The Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photo
 graphing or video recording individuals (including children) without their
  consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian)
 .
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/wildlife-wonders-raven-r
 idge-161283
