SUMMARY:Lego Block Party!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260727T190000
UID:54b55a8e8976746d4f63596fddc5e591@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nRegistration for 
 Lego Block Party will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 15th for Manheim 
 Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 22nd for resi
 dents of other municipalities.For youth ages 8-12 years of age only.The LE
 GO Block Party at the library is a fun and creative program where children
  ages 8-12 come together to build various creations using LEGO bricks. Par
 ticipants often have the opportunity to work individually or in teams to d
 esign and construct imaginative structures\, vehicles\, and scenes based o
 n a theme or their own imagination. The club typically fosters collaborati
 on\, problem-solving\, and fine motor skills while encouraging a love for 
 building and creativity. It's a great way for community members to sociali
 ze\, learn\, and have fun in a supportive environment.Library Program Poli
 ciesNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than
  2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for fut
 ure programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your regist
 rations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for th
 ose on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration sta
 tus.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the p
 rogram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begi
 n promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfei
 ted to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\,
  registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will n
 ot be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Check I
 n - All participants must provide an emergency contact number upon registr
 ation or at the start of the program.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/lego-block-party-172197
