DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nRegis
 tration for Harry Potter: Care of Magical Creatures 101 will open at 9:00A
 M on Wednesday\, July 15th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter resident
 s and on Wednesday\, July 22nd for residents of other municipalities.Regis
 tration Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, please register ev
 ery person who will be attending\, including adults or siblings.The Care o
 f Magical Creatures program is conducted by Critter Connections. The progr
 am covers a wide array of magical creatures\, ranging from the familiar to
  the exotic. Students learn about their habitats\, behaviors\, magical pro
 perties\, and how to interact with them safely. This is a fascinating cour
 se within the wizarding curriculum\, typically offered at magical institut
 ions such as Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. You will learn ab
 out snakes\, toads\, bearded dragons\, and many more.Library Policies:No S
 how – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 libra
 ry programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future prog
 rams for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations 
 at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on t
 he waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late
  Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program t
 o allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin prompt
 ly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to t
 hose on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registr
 ants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be pe
 rmitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.PhotographyThe 
 Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photograp
 hing or video recording individuals (including children) without their con
 sent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
