UID:b72893b8392ef4a2beedfe0216593968@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nSome dinosaurs\, such as
  the Barosaurus\, were quite large and may have weighed as much as 35 tons
 . But other dinosaurs\, such as Compsognathus\, were about the size of a c
 hicken and weighed only eight pounds. Join a Naturalist to learn just how 
 big they were in comparison to modern day creatures and landmarks by compl
 eting activities and putting your knowledge to the test! 🦕🦖*This pro
 gram is recommended for children ages 6 - 12. Registration for How Big Wer
 e the Dinosaurs  will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd for Manheim 
 Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 29th for resi
 dents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies Registration Requir
 ements –  To help us manage our space\, please register every person who
  will be attending\, including adults or siblings.    No Show – Patron
 s failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in
  a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a per
 iod of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hou
 rs prior to the start of the program to allow those on the waiting list to
  be notified of their change in registration status. Late Arrivals – P
 lease arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for
  parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the d
 esignated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the
  wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be
  allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted
  to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time. Accompanying Adults 
 – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please pl
 an to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitt
 ed.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/how-big-were-dinosaurs-l
 ancaster-county-parks-170778
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
