DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Teens\n\nRegistration for Teen Video
  Gaming: Super Smash Bros. will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 22nd fo
 r Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 29t
 h for residents of other municipalities.For Teens ages 13-18 years of age 
 only.Only registrants will be allowed in the room.Get ready to brawl! Join
  us for an epic Super Smash Bros. Ultimate Tournament on the Nintendo Swit
 ch\, where teens battle it out for bragging rights and prizes. Whether you
 're a seasoned fighter or a casual button-masher\, this tournament is open
  to all skill levels. Come solo or bring your crew—only one will be crow
 ned Smash Champion!We’ll kick things off with warm-up rounds\, then dive
  into a bracket-style tournament with 1v1 matches on the big screen. Betwe
 en matches\, enjoy snacks\, cheer on your friends\, and hang out in a chil
 l\, gamer-friendly space.Note: To help everyone stay present and get the m
 ost out of the experience\, we ask that all phones stay in pockets or bags
  during the program. Thank you for your cooperation!Library Program Polici
 esNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2
  library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for futur
