 e on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration statu
 s.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the pro
 gram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin 
 promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeite
 d to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, r
 egistrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not
  be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Check In 
 - All participants must provide an emergency contact number upon registrat
 ion or at the start of the program.Designated Ages – Please adhere to 
 the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only children in tha
 t age range will be admitted.
