 d his scaley sidekicks\, and check out some animal books\, too!Appropriate
  for all ages.*For the safety and supervision of all participants: Childre
 n under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the program
 . Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program independentl
