 ot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. 
 If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, r
 egistrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the s
 tart time.PhotographyThe Manheim Township Public Library Code of Conduct P
 olicy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (including ch
 ildren) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the consent of 
