X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/copy-saturday-songs-and-smiles-steven-courtney-170907"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Saturday Songs and Smiles with Steven Courtney
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T113000
UID:fe228228d91125bb7f2808a66cfacd67@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Babies\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\, Adults
 \n\nRegistration for Saturday Songs and Smiles with Steven Courtney will o
 pen at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 29th for Manheim Township and East Lampe
 ter residents and on Wednesday\, August 5th for residents of other municip
 alities.Registration Requirements –  To help us manage our space\, pleas
 e register every person who will be attending\, including adults or siblin
 gs.Get ready for a high-energy\, family-friendly concert with award-winnin
 g musician Steven Courtney! Known for his engaging songs\, positive messag
 es\, and interactive performances\, Steven brings joy to audiences of all 
 ages with his blend of rock\, folk\, and playful storytelling. Whether you
 're clapping along\, dancing in your seat\, or singing out loud\, this mus
 ical event promises fun for the whole family. Perfect for children ages 3 
 and up and their caregivers. Don’t miss this toe-tapping\, smile-sparkin
 g celebration of music and imagination!*For the safety and supervision of 
 all participants: Children under 8 years old must be accompanied by an adu
 lt throughout the program. Children ages 8 and older are welcome to attend
  the program independently.  Library Program PoliciesNo Show – Patrons f
 ailing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a 
 month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period
  of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours 
 prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list t
 o be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Ple
 ase arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parki
 ng and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designa
 ted time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait 
 list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allow
 ed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter 
 the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography - The Manheim Townsh
 ip Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video 
 recording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in th
 e case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/copy-saturday-songs-and-
 smiles-steven-courtney-170907
