X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:Silent Book Club at Our Town Brewery!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260817T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260817T200000
UID:724f632f607a42218163fd70d57ff8c7@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nAll the perks of a
  book club\, but none of the stress!Join us at Our Town Brewery this month
  for our meeting of the Silent Book Club\, a program which gives you unint
 errupted reading time and the chance to chat with fellow booklovers but le
 aves behind the headaches of reading deadlines and the pressure to sound i
 nsightful.Find us on the Brewery's 1st floor—we'll be the ones with the 
 books!With no assigned title and no list of discussion questions\, all you
  need to bring is your current read and your enthusiasm for literature!· 
