BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lancaster Libraries": "https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-adult-services-people-pennsylvanias-past-program-171890"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lancaster_libraries
SUMMARY:The Original Pennsylvanians: Life Before the Frontier
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T194500
UID:9529d8f2f8f55470a865c0d9721c28ac@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nSt
 ep back in time with the Lancaster County Department of Parks & Recreation
  to discover the thriving world that existed long before the modern map wa
 s drawn. Through a vivid collection of historic photos\, we will explore t
 he sophisticated innovation and ancient wisdom of Pennsylvania's first inh
 abitants. This presentation reveals the "forest pharmacy" of medicinal pla
 nts\, the expert craftsmanship behind essential tools\, and the architectu
 ral secrets of early housing. You will gain a new perspective on how Nativ
 e American communities thrived through unique social traditions and expert
  survival techniques before the "Old World" ever met the New. Join us to r
 econnect with the deep\, hidden history of the land we call home.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center B
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-adult-services-
 people-pennsylvanias-past-program-171890
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
