DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Babies\n\nBook Babies is a special time for babies
  to share stories\, songs\, rhymes and games with their grown-ups. Come pl
 ay with us in the Children’s Library! (Newborn to 17 months\, with adult
 ) Please add any additional registrants to your registration if more than 
 one child that will be participating in the program.Registration for Book 
 Babies will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 5th for Manheim Township 
 and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, August 7th for residents of ot
 her municipalities.Storytime PoliciesProgram Limits - Patrons are limited 
 to one session of multiple session programs per week.Cancellations- Please
  check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not be
 en cancelled.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for 
 more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registerin
 g for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel yo
 ur registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to all
 ow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registr
 ation status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start
  of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program 
 will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will 
 be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots
  remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registran
 ts will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start tim
 e.
